	"description": [
		"Lately it seems disasters and crisis characterize our contemporary moment. What are the social implications of these phenomena? How do we attempt to understand them, as expansive as they are? When is a disaster over? What are the politics of disaster? This course explores these questions, examining disasters through various media: ethnography, film, journalism."
